$${\rm{if }}V > 0{\rm{mV then }}\left\{ {\matrix{ {V \to Vr} \cr {w \to {w_r} = w + b} \cr } } \right.$$
\end{document}.

A mathematical analysis (Touboul 2008) has shown that under the condition a/g
L > τ
m/τ
w the transition occurs via the Andronov-Hopf bifurcation at the value: \documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
