$${I_{{\rm{AH}}}} = ({g_L} + a)\left[ {{V_T} - {E_L} - {_T} + {_T}{\rm{ln}}\left( {1 + {{{\tau _m}} \over {{\tau _w}}}} \right)} \right] + {_T}{g_L}\left( {{a \over {{g_L}}} - {{{\tau _m}} \over {{\tau _w}}}} \right)$$
\end{document}, and otherwise (a/g
L < τ
m/τ
w) via the saddle-node bifurcation at the value \documentclass[12pt]{minimal}
