$$X(V) = {\tau \over {{\tau _w}{g_L}}}\left[ {I - (a + {g_L})(V - {E_L})} \right]$$
\end{document}. below it (Gerstner and Kistler 2002). In the case of piecewise linear nullclines, the trajectory can hence be obtained analytically.

